          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Northwind started in 2014 with one wheel in a Portland garage and a simple rule: make fewer things, and make them to last. Today a team of twelve designs every piece in Oregon and works with four family-run workshops across Europe."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We never run seasonal sales. Instead we price fairly all year, and we repair what we sell."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  { "type": "text", "text": "Free repairs on knitwear for the first two years" }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Glaze batch and maker stamped on every ceramic piece"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
